  "rules": [
    "A world event represents something that actually exists in authoritative campaign state.",
    "Mission generation may react to an event but may not create the underlying event merely to justify a mission.",
    "World events can exist without ever becoming player missions.",
    "Resolution can change political, logistical, scientific, personnel or ship state.",
    "World events may be known incompletely or not at all by the player's current observers.",
